    <item>
      <title>0.1.4 (202611190527)</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 05:30:40 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611190527</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
- **New Org Board**: pick a starting structure: Seven Divisions, Departments, People Only, Startup, Agency, Blank, or copy the structure of a board in another of your workspaces (without its people).
- **Division colour**: on iPhone and iPad, pick any colour for a division from the system colour picker.
]]></description>
