    <item>
      <title>0.1.4 (202611190110)</title>
      <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 01:20:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611190110</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
**Org Board**: how your company is run, in Connect.

- Divisions, departments and posts, who holds each post and who gives orders to whom.
- Put people and agents on posts (several can hold one), drag posts and people on the board.
- Products and statistics on the cards; a statistic's own page to write this week's number.
- Table and Full view, a PDF poster to print, and one branch in focus.
- Versions: publish the board with a note, restore an earlier one.
]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/srgplus/srgplus-connect-macos/releases/latest/download/SRG-Plus-Connect.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="ZWwDeJJF0WTfebOpbdi9/YTWehfbnuy/foIRCr9ZpoyUq370E5V7bhUPWW8+xppblwCyfov9iERnkhprt/6YAw==" length="10756631" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.1.4 (202611182132)</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:36:03 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611182132</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
- **Updates install by themselves.** The app checks every hour and installs a new version when you quit it. Opened from the disk image or Downloads, it first offers to move itself into Applications, where updates can reach it.
- **Facebook Messenger, WhatsApp Business and Telegram** connect next to Instagram.
- Remove a social account from its page or its row menu.
- Real network logos instead of letters, and Settings at the bottom of the sidebar.
- The Subscription screen shows your plan.
]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/srgplus/srgplus-connect-macos/releases/latest/download/SRG-Plus-Connect.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="lg5WBpgWGpsrSjOieZLJt89Yhz0dKbHm+k05wvGAjIpsNxorVqU2GVwDpOrr/ZVDaAo/tNJ4pDN9tTSE0BH8BA==" length="9622438" />
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>0.1.4 (202611162348)</title>
      <pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:52:35 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611162348</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.4</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[
What's new since the last Mac download (0.1.4, November 5):

- Banks: connect your business bank accounts under Accounts, each with its own logo and colours, and check or remove them. Connecting, reconnecting or removing a bank asks for a code from your authenticator app first.
- Stripe: sign in to several Stripe accounts on the Stripe tile and see each one.
- Accounts: Social Accounts and Brands (connect an account, add a brand), Google Business Profile locations, and Partners under Users.
- Connectors: a "Shared with you" section and a table view. A member's Tools are listed by connector; click one to see its tools.
- Routines: pick SRG+ CRM events as a trigger in New Routine and Edit.
- History: Owners and Admins can clear the red mark on a finished run.
- Agents: an agent's page shows who can write, the models it can use and its highest reasoning level.
- Privacy Policy links in the app.
]]></description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/srgplus/srgplus-connect-macos/releases/latest/download/SRG-Plus-Connect.dmg" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="tSeZR39nU1eriJQrEDa+iJd5NFIAExgrJ/5V/eaCxILWSuMxaP0u9f5ugnyLj037XiT3uQaVEJdFcfCdy/DCDg==" length="8316293" />
